 To change behaviour for every caller, replace. Clean up the stack the way the
 original did (`g_esp += 12` for a `ret 8`).
 
+For narrowly scoped memory-mapped publication, a manual definition
+`void sub_XXXXXXXX_store32(uint32_t address, uint32_t value)` redirects
+ordinary 32-bit `MOV` stores in that generated function to the callback.
+The callback must perform ordinary stores itself and handle its selected
+registers. This does not intercept other store instructions or other
+functions; use an independent fail-closed guard if complete interception is
+required. Regenerate after adding or changing the hook.
+
